  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Engineering hand-solder lands for owned 9650 Active 3V SMD stock; two opposing contacts only. 9.6mm nominal square envelope. Lands cover Jianghai Wuyin SMD-9650-3327 and Jialigao SMT-9650-3327 published nominal contacts; actual stock fit/polarity must be checked. Not a manufacturer-recommended universal land pattern. See docs/OWNED_BUZZER_AND_MECHANICALS.md. https://en.jlg-sound.com/productshow-46057459.html ; https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/8a67125568be7bd18b7193976db880d1.pdf")
  (tags "9650 active 3V owned stock buzzer SMD hand solder conditional fit")
